Activate.text:
{color=#442554}I see. And I should hope you do as well.{/color}

{color=#153b2e}My King?{/color}

{color=#442554}Greatness, and the desire for it. Make no mistake, you can inform the generals I am pleased with the progress of the royal army. But this 'Oryx' has what we truly need. It is one thing to follow orders with skill, but another to chase greatness with all one's power.{/color}

{color=#442554}TRAITOR! FIEND! I treat him as though he were my own son, and he means to take the lands for himself?!{/color}

{color=#141f52}My Ki-{/color}

{color=#442554}He was to be my proud successor! To expand the reach of my kingdom and unite the realm under our prosperity!{/color}

{color=#141f52}MY KING! I come not to offer you empty platitudes, but a tactical option. One which you should already be aware of...{/color}

{color=#442554}I...{/color}

{color=#141f52}Oryx will surely make his way here soon. If you fail to act, the empire you have worked to build will crumble before it ever sees the mainland!{/color}

{color=#442554}I HAVE FAILED NOTHING! ...and yet, you are correct...{/color}

{color=#141f52}Please, my King, come this way at once! I have already made the preparations.{/color}

{color=#141f52}In just moments, my King, you and your army will have the power to utterly overwhelm this defector!{/color}

{color=#442554}...very well. I trust you will keep my Queen at ease should I not reawaken for some hours?{/color}

{color=#141f52}Oh yes, my King. I will always serve the Crown.{/color}

{i}...that from which is everything that exists and from which it first becomes and into which it is rendered at last...

...the principle of things that are...

{color=#30647e}...and in the year of the Great Flood, a creature of the waves - nay, a creature that was wave in itself, was captured and harnessed by the...{/color}{/i}

{i}...that which we call aether, and that which we call mist and darkness, and the void beyond for which no name exist in the...

...wherein force manifests its purest form, malleable for the...

{color=#30647e}...and as it bore aloft the very roof of our abode, my master said 'Behold, that which I control, and with which I will...{/color}{/i}

{i}...that upon which walks everything that lives and around which the Celestial Dome revolves...

{color=#30647e}...and we named ourselves creatures of the Earth, and to the Earth we returned, for aeons...

...our livelihood, but we sought more...{/color}{/i}

